- Evidence: Shared baseline Python, focused hooks/cache/confinement suites: **52 passed, 1 skipped** (native-X opt-in). Native-X opt-in separately: **1 passed, 23 deselected**; two real Xvfb instances verify own-cookie access and missing/wrong/sibling-cookie denial after abstract-socket connection, plus confirmed cleanup. Ruff check and format check passed on all 14 reviewed source/test files. Offline tool package metadata: Xvfb `2:21.1.16-1.3+deb13u4` amd64; x11vnc `0.9.17-1` amd64 (x11vnc execution is outside this review). No implementation/test edits or git branch/index/commit/push operations.
